  "provenance": [
    "DS12110 Rev11 January2026: STM32H743ZI 2MiB Flash/LQFP144; Figure57 physical PC2_C/PC3_C pads do not imply direct PC2/PC3 GPIO routes.",
    "RM0433 Rev9 October2026 pp106-109/136-137: MDMA reaches TCM; DMA1/DMA2 cannot; BDMA confined to D3 SRAM4/backup. Bus reachability does not authorize DMA placement, power state or retention.",
    "RM0433 Rev9 section6.4.1 p262: Run* forbids any RAM write before ACTVOSRDY; ExitRun0Mode must not use stack. Fixed HSI64 profile uses conservative reset Flash7WS and LDO; Cache remains off.",
    "https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/stm32h743zi.pdf",
    "https://www.st.com/resource/en/reference_manual/rm0433-stm32h742-stm32h743753-and-stm32h750-value-line-advanced-armbased-32bit-mcus-stmicroelectronics.pdf",
