    "RM0433 Rev9 SPI v3 TSIZE/EOT/TXC/IFCR and APB2-clocked SPI4 SPI45SEL=0; DS12110 AF5 PE12/PE13/PE14 and TIM3 CH1 PA6 AF2. Selected finite software references only; ES0392 silicon revision and physical electrical timing remain unqualified."
